  2. COMBAT MODEL (implement exactly)
  =====================================================================
  - World units: 1 unit = 1 px at zoom 1. Sim tick 30 Hz; server snapshot rate 10 Hz.
  - Vehicle stats: hull (HP, regenerates only in safe zone/with repair), armor (second bar, absorbs damage, regenerates after 8 s without damage at 4%/s of max), speed, turn rate, turret turn rate, radius, slots.
  - Damage resolution: incoming damage D with impact angle theta relative to the target's chassis facing: front arc (|theta|<=45 deg) x0.7, side x1.0, rear (|theta|>=135) x1.4. Armor absorbs 80% of D until depleted; the remaining 20% (and 100% when armor is 0) goes to hull. Flat damage reduction from armor parts and talents is applied before the split (never below 10% of D). Critical hits (chance from talents/parts) x1.5.
  - Main cannon: range 700 (varies by weapon), reload per weapon, projectile speed, damage, ammo type multipliers (see ammo). Machine gun: range 300, rate-of-fire based, low damage, unlimited ammo.
  - Ammo types (per slot, bought/crafted/dropped as stacks): STANDARD (free, unlimited, 1.0x), REINFORCED (1.25x, costs scrap), ARMOR-PIERCING (ignores 40% of target armor reduction; x1.0 vs light, x0.8 vs heavy bodies... define by armor class), SHAPED CHARGE (x1.6 vs bosses/bunkers, x0.7 vs vehicles), EXPLOSIVE (small splash radius 60, x0.85). If special ammo is out, auto-fallback to STANDARD.
  - Abilities (cooldown, duration): Smoke (enemies lose lock, 4 s), Repair Kit (heal 25% hull over 5 s, canceled by damage), Boost (+30% speed, -25% reload, 6 s), Radar Pulse (reveals stealth/off-screen enemies in 1200 range, 3 s), Emergency Shield (invulnerable 2 s), plus class abilities: Scout: Dash; Medium: Overcharge; Heavy: Fortify (+40% armor, -40% speed); Artillery: Barrage (ground-targeted splash volley); Support: Repair Aura (heals nearby allies).
  - Status effects: Slowed, Burning (DoT), Stunned (EMP, 1.5 s, diminishing returns), Marked (+15% damage taken), Smoked. Stacking rules and immunity windows in /shared/rules/status.ts.
  - Targeting: lock range 800, lock lost when target leaves range+10%, is smoked, dies, or is in a safe zone. PvP lock only on valid PvP targets (see section 11).
  - Death: wreck stays 8 s, respawn at the home base (or nearest rescue point) with 5 s invulnerability. No item loss ever. Repair cost in scrap (0 for level < 10) scaled by vehicle tier. In PvP maps: honor loss (see section 11).
  - Collisions: vehicle-vs-obstacle (circle/polygon), vehicle-vs-vehicle soft push. Terrain zones: slow (mud/water/snow x0.6), no instant death.
  - Time-to-kill targets used for balancing tests: normal enemy 5-15 s, elite 30-60 s, boss 3-8 min (group), PvP 20-40 s at equal gear.

